+# SI-E2 runtime boundary engineering contract
+
+Status: ENGINEERING IMPLEMENTATION ONLY. No release is included. Acquisition96, training,
+evaluation, historical reruns and scientific launch remain NOT_GRANTED. The original
+a995 collector, synthetic journal gates, prompts, parsers, scientific budgets, frozen
+training recipe and all previous methods are unchanged. This package does not make
+that collector accept engineering or live evidence, and does not implement a real
+collection or training driver.
+
+## Distinct engineering path
+
+1. The supervisor authenticates externally issued authorization **raw bytes** against
+   the SHA supplied in the independently approved command. It checks the exact clean
+   Git revision, proposal byte hash, unique canonical output identity, one GPU UUID,
+   UTC window, fixed diagnostic shape and ceilings. An `issuer` string is not a
+   signature: the expected authorization SHA must be supplied by the coordinator's
+   separate immutable release, never inferred from an author-created JSON file.
+2. Offline base files are checked against the unchanged committed R19 identity
+   manifest. P0 directory bytes must match the frozen P0 hash. The historical YAML,
+   game, traj_data, source JSONL and original ledger are hash-bound; effective domain
+   and grammar file contents are separately checked. The known runtime modules in
+   the proposal must match actual loaded paths, hashes and public module versions.
+   `version` is the module public __version__ (empty if absent), matching the root
+   binding artifact; installed distribution versions are separately recorded. An
+   absent public version is never invented from a different source.
+3. A fresh-session child uses the exact isolated interpreter/script. Supervisor PID,
+   command, source, authorization and output markers are cross-checked; a parent-death
+   signal closes the normal orphan route. The external monotonic deadline includes
+   loading and blocking generation/environment callbacks. Cleanup kills its own
+   process group and observed descendants (PID/start tick/UID checked), including
+   children that create another session, then reaps them. Existing graphics/compute
+   processes are never killed. Authentic return code, surviving descendants, timing
+   and missing child reports are persisted; a killed child report is not fabricated.
+4. Before full model allocation, a one-byte CUDA context checks actual UUID and
+   observable own NVML compute PID. Unknown PID namespaces/ownership stop cheaply.
+   Exactly one visible A40 is required; foreign compute on it is rejected. Actual
+   base parameters must stay BF16, no CPU/disk offload or quantization. PEFT's default
+   F32 LoRA behavior is preserved. Actual Qwen3 local config and `sdpa` implementation
+   are asserted and recorded rather than inferred from a default.
+5. The unchanged Qwen loader supplies the local tokenizer/base, and the frozen P0 is
+   loaded with `PeftModel.from_pretrained(..., is_trainable=False)`. P0 calls observe
+   enabled layers. BASE calls use the real `disable_adapter()` context. Both model
+   and every layer must have consistent enabled flags, active `default` name and no
+   merged adapters. Original gradient flags are explicitly restored on normal and
+   exceptional exits: installed PEFT otherwise re-enables LoRA trainability. This is
+   inference restoration, not an optimizer step or a dtype conversion.
+6. All four prompts are fixed by `engineering_prompts()` and their digest is in the
+   proposal before execution: source16, Stage1 40, Stage2 16, suffix16. Stage2 uses a
+   predeclared **synthetic** diagnosis/subgoal. Actual Stage1 text never changes it.
+   This exercises independent runtime modes, not a causal teacher branch. Frozen v2
+   parsers and P0 decisions report invalid/incomplete text honestly; no retries,
+   fallback, action tuning or semantic-success requirement occurs. No generated
+   command is executed in the environment.
+7. Full rendered input IDs and attention masks are compared against the exact
+   tensors passed to `generate`, before the external-generation reservation. The
+   strict old `Generation.raw` keys stay unchanged; supplemental tensor/state proof
+   is separate. Greedy/no-thinking/score/token/EOS semantics remain frozen. All four
+   known input lengths/caps are checked upfront, with per-call ceilings enforced again.
+8. Environment exercise uses only the first predetermined completed G3 TRAIN source,
+   canonical hash `fba2a4278c4f1d9640c1c39f527fe3d5e7022ab50af4d353bc017bb31bbead89`,
+   executed at2da. The original reset/transition receipt references supply after-maps;
+   trajectory `valid_actions` is a before-map. Saved game/traj hashes cross-match row
+   metadata and the completion event. Two FRESH one-game instances use the same
+   TextWorld pool seed. This avoids treating reset(seed) as reseeding an already
+   advanced TextWorld RNG. The six saved commands imply a proposal cap of2 resets /
+   12 steps. Goal, task, observation, reward, done, truncation and map **order** all
+   match. Missing terminal maps remain null evidence and cause a strict mismatch,
+   never become an invented empty map. A nonterminal reference cannot establish
+   terminal behavior and cannot trigger outcome search.
+9. The new factory restricts effective dataset.data_path to the authenticated task
+   directory BEFORE ALFWorld construction, and uses a no-scan one-game subclass.
+   Original YAML bytes, domain randomization, expert type, wrappers and action
+   semantics are unchanged. The intentional discovery restriction is recorded.
+   The old exact-task helper is not repaired or invoked here: its constructor scans
+   global TRAIN before overwriting game_files and would open reserved task bodies.
+10. An independent engineering ledger fsyncs starts/completions and raw evidence.
+    Cost reconstruction sums actual completed calls plus full conservative open/failed
+    reservations, and rejects altered summaries or input/tensor proof even with a
+    rewritten hash chain. Environment construct/close counts remain separate from
+    resets/actions. Incomplete operations are not task failures and are never retried.
+
+## Proposal and command for independent review
+
+Schemas: `configs/self_improvement/si_e2_proposal_schema_v1.json` and
+`si_e2_authorization_schema_v1.json`. Runtime checks add semantic constraints to
+these declarative wire schemas; no external JSON-schema package is required.
+
+The proposal carries ONLY explicit local runtime paths and hashes: base snapshot,
+P0, original completed source JSONL/ledger, YAML/game/traj_data, data root, domain/
+grammar, interpreter bytes, eight fixed module origins/versions and fixed-prompt
+set digest. It carries no collection schedule, new task payload, generated action,
+training recipe, quantization option or policy threshold. Machine-specific values
+belong in runtime arguments or ignored configs/local, never in a scientific commit.
+
+The coordinator must first review the frozen source and then approve the exact
+proposal, authorization bytes, interpreter, argv, environment, UUID and fresh output.
+The following is a **non-executable template**, not permission or a ready command:
+
+```text
+CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=<one approved GPU UUID> HF_HUB_OFFLINE=1 TRANSFORMERS_OFFLINE=1 \
+  <pinned-python> -I <reviewed-checkout>/scripts/run_si_p3_engineering_probe.py \
+  --authorization <independently released authorization JSON> \
+  --authorization-sha256 <externally released SHA256 of those exact bytes> \
+  --proposal <immutable proposal JSON>
+```
+
+The authorization binds the final source SHA (not a995 or an old clearance), proposal
+raw SHA, UUID, fresh output path, UTC window and ceilings. Maxima1800 seconds /0.5
+allocated device-hours /4 generations /88 output /32768 input /8192 per input /
+2 resets /100 steps can only tighten; the known six-step replay should use12 steps.
+Fixed four-call/output/reset worst cases must fit before construction. An output
+identity is consumed even by a failed or killed attempt; no overwrite/retry occurs.
+No valid authorization is shipped. No engineering runtime probe has been run by
+the developer. Luna must propose concrete immutable inputs for a later root release.
+
+## Verification and limits
+
+Software tests use real tiny CPU PEFT state, a real small CPU generate case, explicit
+raw generation/TextWorld edges, original prompt/parsers and real ledger/consumer.
+A nonempty four-phase/two-replay path reaches the report. Negative tests cover
+wrong authority/SHA/UUID/ownership/origins, input tensors/masks, adapter switching,
+unknown reservations and cost tamper; actual subprocess tests cover exit failure,
+path reuse and worker/descendant deadlines. Fixtures are explicitly synthetic;
+software supervisor receipts count ZERO actual allocated GPUs.
+
+Until independently observed: actual8B/P0 load/adapter state, installed environment
+behavior, terminal-map availability, PID visibility, peak GPU memory/latency and
+GPU completion are NOT_VERIFIED. No memory estimate establishes BF16 training fit,
+optimizer/activation peak or96-source completion. New B/C experience/exposure,
+learning effects, efficacy and any statistical reporter remain unimplemented or
+unobserved. No independent engineering PASS, scientific PASS or launch authority
+belongs to the developer.
